    - S key to break 🐢 / slow down 🐌

    - Pick up orbs to score points ✨ and fill boost meter! 🔋
    - Avoid obstacles! ⬛ If you hit one you lose a life 💔
    - If you lose all lives it's game over and you have to start over! 🪦
    - Pick up HEARTS to gain a life! 💖

