    You can also use ARROW KEYS ⬅️➡️ instead of WASD keys and mouse to move

    You can disable pickup flashes 💥🔦 by setting the define below to 0

    If you have a powerful GPU you can enable
    HIGH QUALITY radial blur by setting the define below it to 1
    or disable it completely to improve performance

    Developed on 60 FPS, tested on 30 and 240 fps. High framerate recommended! 🏎️

    There are further parameters in the COMMON tab!

